Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.75,Center,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1040)}I didn't get a second chance at life just to live cautiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.47,0:00:05.67,Center,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1040)}In 2022, an ostomy saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:09.89,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}Nine months later, I was competing in\Ntriathlons with a product designed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.89,0:00:12.97,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}for people like me never made the same\Ntransition from patient to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:13.37,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:16.85,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}So I'm building the product I spent years\Nwishing existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:20.81,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}A discreet athletic support belt designed\Nfor people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:24.09,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}with this condition who refuse to let it\Nlimit the way they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:27.27,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}live, whether that's competing in a\Ntriathlon, HYROX,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:28.57,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}or simply going to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:32.53,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}I'm not looking to make a slightly better\Nversion of what already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:32.91,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:36.81,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}I'm wanting to rethink the entire category\Nall the way down to the material,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:37.91,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}shape, and design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.13,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}The goal is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:42.77,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}When someone puts it on, I want them\Nthinking about what they're doing and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:43.57,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}not their ostomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:45.47,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}And this isn't a small community.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:49.43,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}Approximately one million Americans are\Nliving with this ostomy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:52.45,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}condition, including 200,000 between the\Nages of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:55.63,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}13 and 44, representing a $24 million
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:57.09,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}annual addressable market.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:00:58.93,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}And this is not a stagnant market.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:02.47,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}The conditions driving ostomy surgeries\Nare increasing, particularly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:04.11,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}amongst younger Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:07.57,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}The problem isn't that ostomy support\Nproducts don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:10.85,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}It's the category hasn't evolved with the\Npeople who depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.87,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}Shopping for products from a Stealth Belt,\NSIIL ostomy can often
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:17.55,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}feel like going to a retirement home to\Nbuy your everyday apparel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:21.13,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}The products exist, but they don't reflect\Nthe way younger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:23.01,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}customers want it to feel look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:27.17,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}Our product will retail at $120 per unit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:30.29,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}with a targeted COGS of approximately 10%\Nof retail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:30.63,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}price.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:34.47,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}A portion of every purchase will help\Nprovide essential ostomy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:37.61,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}supplies to people without health\Ninsurance who can't afford
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:38.19,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.17,0:01:42.47,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}With a $3,000 prize money, we will be able\Nto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:45.79,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}take our 3D design off the screen and into\Nthe hands of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:47.59,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}a professional prototyping studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.69,0:01:51.99,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}I have began developing teams of graduate\Nstudents,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:55.37,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}software engineers, and even medical\Nprofessionals to assist with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.37,0:01:58.67,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}our company's mission to improve the\Nquality of life for this underserved
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:01:59.05,Left,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(54,1040)}community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:02.99,Center,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1040)}I know this problem personally because I live with it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:05.17,Center,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1040)}I'm not trying to create just another product.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:07.91,Center,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1040)}I want to bring to the market the product I wish I had.
